-- BOTH address and localAddress are set. AzerothCore's
-- Realm::GetAddressForClient hands out localAddress to a client whose IP
-- is inside localAddress/localSubnetMask (and to a loopback client), and
-- address to everyone else. With both equal, every client is told the
-- Tailscale address whichever branch it takes, so localSubnetMask cannot
-- override it for a client outside the LAN.

$ docker exec ac-database mysql -e "UPDATE acore_auth.realmlist SET address='100.71.125.58', localAddress='100.71.125.58' WHERE id=1; SELECT ROW_COUNT() AS rows_changed;"
